## Required Vercel Environment Variables

Set these in your Vercel project → Settings → Environment Variables:

| Variable | Value | Where to get it |
|---|---|---|
| `TWITTER_CLIENT_ID` | Your OAuth 2.0 Client ID | developer.twitter.com → Your App → Keys |
| `TWITTER_CLIENT_SECRET` | Your OAuth 2.0 Client Secret | Same as above |
| `AXOMEX_TWITTER_ID` | Numeric Twitter ID of @AxomexNFT | Use tweeterid.com or twiidfinder.com |
| `FORM_TOKEN` | Any secret string (fallback bypass token) | Make one up, e.g. `openssl rand -hex 16` |
| `COOKIE_SECRET` | Secret for signing cookies | `openssl rand -hex 32` |

**How to find AXOMEX_TWITTER_ID:**
Go to https://tweeterid.com, enter `@AxomexNFT`, copy the numeric ID.

